abstract: >-
  A config-driven Snakemake and Python pipeline integrating TCGA RNA-seq expression
  and GISTIC2 gene-level copy number variation for leak-free cross-validated clinical
  classification, SHAP biomarker attribution, and out-of-fold penalized Cox/Kaplan-Meier
  survival stratification.
